<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish September non-EU exports 803.4 mln punts - CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish September non-EU exports 803.4 mln punts - CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's exports to countries outside the European Union rose to a seasonally adjusted 803.4 million Irish pounds in September from 659.8 million Irish pounds in August, the Central Statistics said.</p>
<p>Imports from non-EU countries rose to a seasonally adjusted 650.1 million Irish pounds from 532.5 million in August, the CSO said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 6603377</p>
